{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"理想层"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"理想层"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>理想层是环"},{"Local":{"url":"层","text":"层"}},{"Plain":"的理想. "},{"Local":{"url":"环化空间","text":"环化空间"}},{"Plain":"的理想层对应"},{"Local":{"url":"闭嵌入","text":"闭子空间"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>设 $(X,A)$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"环化空间","text":"环化空间"}},{"Plain":", 则 $A$ 作为 $A$-模的子 $A$-模称为理想层.</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<p>设 $Z$ 是局部 "},{"Local":{"url":"Noether概形","text":"Noether 概形"}},{"Plain":" $X$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"闭嵌入","text":"闭子概形"}},{"Plain":", 在 $Z$ 上消失的正则函数层 $I_{Z/X}$ 是 $\\mathcal O_X$ 的理想层, 它是 $X$ 上的"},{"Local":{"url":"凝聚层","text":"凝聚层"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>另见"},{"Local":{"url":"(余)切丛","text":"切丛"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"(余)法丛","text":"法丛"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}